====

Before LangChain

Around 2020–2022, developers started experimenting with AI models like GPT-3. Building AI applications was difficult because developers had to write separate code for:

Calling the LLM API
Reading PDFs
Searching databases
Storing conversation history
Connecting external APIs
Creating prompts
Managing workflows

Every project repeated the same code.

Harrison Chase noticed these repeated patterns while working as a machine learning engineer.

